        "title": "CNNC to procure contract for high-temperature reactor",
        "link": "https://www.world-nuclear-news.org/articles/cnnc-to-procure-contract-for-high-temperature-reactor",
        "source": "World Nuclear News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.488209+00:00",
