        "title": "First fuel loaded into Tianwan unit 7",
        "link": "https://www.world-nuclear-news.org/articles/first-fuel-loaded-into-tianwan-unit-7",
        "source": "World Nuclear News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.488201+00:00",
