        "title": "As Ukrainian Strikes Hit Hard, Moscow Seeks Deeper Defense Ties With Central Asia",
        "link": "https://www.rferl.org/a/russia-kazakhstan-uzbekistan-military-defense-cooperation/33832996.html",
        "source": "Radio Free Europe / Radio Liberty",
