        "title": "Israel Justified Its Wars by Calling Enemies “Crazy.” Now, the Warning Signs All Apply to Israel.",
        "link": "https://theintercept.com/2026/08/13/israel-palestine-benjamin-netanyahu-likud-crazy/",
        "source": "The Intercept",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.487981+00:00",
