        "title": "U.S. Open to Foreign-Built Warships Under New White House Shipbuilding Order",
        "link": "https://www.navalnews.com/naval-news/2026/08/us-navy-foreign-built-warships-shipbuilding-order/",
        "source": "Naval News",
