        "title": "Taiwan’s Urban Resilience Drills Are Becoming a Core Part of Deterrence",
        "link": "https://thediplomat.com/2026/08/taiwans-urban-resilience-drills-are-becoming-a-core-part-of-deterrence/",
        "source": "The Diplomat",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.474974+00:00",
