        "title": "Is Vietnam’s Energy Transition Entering a New Phase?",
        "link": "https://thediplomat.com/2026/08/is-vietnams-energy-transition-entering-a-new-phase/",
        "source": "The Diplomat",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.474959+00:00",
