        "title": "6 Reasons Why Kim Jong Un Might Want to Meet With Trump",
        "link": "https://thediplomat.com/2026/08/6-reasons-why-kim-jong-un-might-want-to-meet-with-trump/",
        "source": "The Diplomat",
