        "title": "Aid Cuts and Security Risks:  From Health System Disruption  to Human Insecurity",
        "link": "https://www.sipri.org/publications/2026/research-reports/aid-cuts-and-security-risks-health-system-disruption-human-insecurity",
        "source": "RSS",
