        "title": "No charger, no problem: The best ways to charge your phone away from an outlet",
        "link": "https://www.engadget.com/2237259/best-ways-charge-phone-away-from-outlet-no-charger/",
        "source": "Engadget - Technology News & Expert Reviews",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.487742+00:00",
