        "title": "jOOQ 3.19’s new Explicit and Implicit to-many path joins",
        "link": "https://blog.jooq.org/jooq-3-19s-new-explicit-and-implicit-to-many-path-joins/",
        "source": "Java, SQL and jOOQ.",
