        "full_content": "This is the August 18, 2026, edition of “The Tea, Spilled by Morning Joe” newsletter.Subscribe hereto get it delivered straight to your inbox every Monday through Friday.\n“Someday, your children will come across your disgusting and inhumane question. They will be sickened and embarrassed to have a parent be so callous and vindictive.”\n— An official White House social media account, attacking CNN’s Kristen Holmes and her children after she asked the president a question\nProverbs warns that whoever digs a pit for another will fall into it.\nJon Ossoff hit the president hard at a rally in Atlanta on Sunday. If Donald Trump didn’t like what he said, why spend the next several days giving him more publicity?\nThis is the Trump team being trumped.\nOssoff threw a lot at the president. The White House seized on one line from a question CNN’s Kristen Holmes asked and extended the story two, three, four days — giving Ossoff exactly what he wanted.\nIt’s doing this as Trump’s approval rating hits an all-time low of 33% and Republicans worry that even rock-solid red states like Iowa may be at risk in a blue wave.\nIf you’re a Republican on Capitol Hill, you’ve got to be pulling your hair out.\nThe Trump team needs to stop digging — and start focusing on issues that actually matter to American voters.",
