        "title": "Latest polling shows Trump approval sinking, despite his weird boasts",
        "link": "https://www.ms.now/rachel-maddow-show/maddowblog/trump-approval-rating-popularity-midterm-elections-2026",
        "source": "MS NOW",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.472313+00:00",
