        "title": "Justice Dept. Revives Smuggling Charges Against Kilmar Abrego-Garcia",
        "link": "https://www.breitbart.com/crime/2026/08/18/justice-dept-revives-smuggling-charges-against-kilmar-abrego-garcia/",
