        "title": "Trump Administration Plans to Deploy 1,000 Poll Monitors Across America for Midterm Elections",
        "link": "https://www.breitbart.com/midterm-election/2026/08/18/trump-administration-plans-deploy-1000-poll-monitors-across-america-midterm-elections/",
