        "title": "Regional leaders discuss security, cooperation amid Middle East tensions",
        "link": "https://sana.sy/en/middle-east/2332715/",
        "source": "Syrian Arab News Agency (SANA)",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.471917+00:00",
