        "title": "Rodri joins La Liga champions Barcelona from Manchester City",
        "link": "https://www.jamaicaobserver.com/2026/08/18/rodri-joins-la-liga-champions-barcelona-manchester-city/",
        "source": "Jamaica Observer",
