        "title": "Narendra Dabholkar murder: HC grants bail to convict, suspends life sentence",
        "link": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095111/narendra-dabholkar-murder-hc-grants-bail-to-convict-suspends-life-sentence?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
        "source": "Scroll.in",
