        "title": "Meta trial that could reshape Facebook, Instagram gets underway",
        "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/Industry/meta-trial-that-could-reshape-facebook-instagram-gets-underway/article71361969.ece",
        "source": "World News Today: International News Headlines - The Hindu | The Hindu",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.471402+00:00",
