        "title": "OpenAI unveils ChatGPT for Teens with stronger guardrails, parental controls",
        "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/openai-unveils-chatgpt-for-teens-with-stronger-guardrails-parental-controls/article71362103.ece",
