        "title": "Ahmedabad 'Boss Scam' Explained: How cybercrime network linked to Pakistan, China operated",
        "link": "https://www.dnaindia.com/india/report-ahmedabad-boss-scam-how-cybercrime-network-linked-to-pakistan-china-operated-explained-3218745",
