 and Acko Life Insurance are licensed general (non-life) and life insurance providers, respectively. \nAssurelink is awaiting Corporate Agency License from IRDAI to engage in the business of distribution of insurance policies in India. Acko Tech also has investments in other entities.\n*****\nSR/ONP\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        (रिलीज़ आईडी: 2300956)\n                        \tआगंतुक पटल  : 157\n                        \n                              \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                              \n                        \n                        \n                              \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                              \n                        \n                   \n                  ",
