        "title": "Crown appealing post-verdict mistrial in Frank Stronach sexual assault conviction",
        "link": "https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/toronto/frank-stronach-sexual-assault-conviction-mistrial-9.7311215?cmp=rss",
        "source": "CBC | Top Stories News",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.471110+00:00",
