        "title": "Evacuation order lifted for majority of Summerland, B.C., with about 150 structures believed damaged",
        "link": "https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/british-columbia/evacuation-orders-lifted-most-of-summerland-9.7310781?cmp=rss",
        "source": "CBC | Top Stories News",
