        "title": "Google to shift Pixel production to India by 2027 to reduce China dependency: All details",
        "link": "https://www.businesstoday.in/technology/news/story/google-to-shift-pixel-production-to-india-by-2027-to-reduce-china-dependency-all-details-549833-2026-08-18?utm_source=rssfeed",
