        "title": "Award-Winning Comedy Podcast “Scam Goddess” Joins iHeartMedia and Will Ferrell’s Big Money Players Podcast Network, Launches Full-Length Video Episodes For the First Time",
        "link": "https://content.iheartmedia.com/press/award-winning-comedy-podcast-scam-goddess-joins-iheartmedia-and-will-ferrells-big-money",
