        "image": null,
        "full_content": "Listen to today’s new episode featuring Langston Kerman, HERE\nVideo episodes now available, HERE\nWHAT: “Scam Goddess”, the award-winning comedy podcast dedicated to fraud and all those who practice it, joins iHeartMedia and Will Ferrell's Big Money Players podcast network (BMP) and expands into video, allowing fans to watch the full-length episodes for the first time.\nNamed one of TIME Magazine's 10 Best Podcasts of 2022, “Scam Goddess” has grown from an acclaimed podcast into a bestselling book, a Hulu television series and a sold-out national live tour.\nIn every episode, the Scam Goddess herself, Laci Mosley (A Black Lady Sketch Show, iCarly, Going Dutch), covers the hottest scams on the streets today while also giving in-depth breakdowns of the wildest robberies, rackets and capers throughout history. It's like true crime, but without all the death—aka True Con! Plus, Mosley is always joined by hilarious guests like Conan O'Brien, Miranda Cosgrove, Jameela Jamil, Lamorne Morris, Ayo Edebiri, Gayle King, Nicole Byer, Matt Rogers and more. Join the Scam Goddess \"Con-gregation\" to experience the funny side of fraud. And as Mosley always says, “stay schemin'!”\nThe first video episode, “F.R.A.U.D. is Dope the Jonathan Dupiton Con with Langston Kerman,” premieres today and will feature comedian and “My Momma Told Me” host Langston Kerman. He will join the show to break down AI ads, beach ab shots and shoddy merch Jonathan Dupiton released for Dupiton’s podcast \"Rich and Unemployed.\"\nWHO: Comedian Laci Mosley and iHeartMedia and Will Ferrell’s Big Money Players podcast network. See the full lineup of Big Money Player podcasts HERE. Full host bio below.\nWHEN: “Scam Goddess” is available through BMP now, with its first full-length video episode premiering today, August 18, 2026, on YouTube at 12 p.m. PT. New episodes are released weekly on Tuesdays and classic episodes re-released every Friday.\nWHERE: Scam Goddess is distributed by iHeartPodcasts and available on the iHeartRadio app and everywhere podcasts are heard. Listen now, HERE. Video episodes are now available on YouTube.\nAbout Laci Mosley\nComedian, actress, producer, writer, bestselling author, and self-proclaimed \"Queen of Scam,\" Laci Mosley has been at the forefront of the true crime and scam storytelling phenomenon since launching Scam Goddess in 2019. Over the last seven years, she has transformed her original concept into the Scam Goddess empire; a multiplatform franchise spanning podcasting, publishing, television, and live entertainment. Named one of TIME Magazine's 10 Best Podcasts of 2022, Scam Goddess has grown from an acclaimed podcast into a bestselling book, a Hulu television series, and a sold-out national Live Nation tour, with Laci performing her one woman show at iconic venues including House of Blues Chicago and Gramercy Theatre in New York City, as well as Los Angeles, San Francisco, Boston, and Dallas.\nAbout Big Money Players\nFounded by Will Ferrell and iHeartMedia, the Big Money Players Network is the premiere destination for comedy podcasts and home to top comedic talent across a variety of formats and styles – both scripted and unscripted. In addition to audio’s No. 1 comedy “The Ron Burgundy Podcast,” BMP features long-running hits like “Las Culturistas with Matt Rogers and Bowen Yang,” “Thanks Dad with Ego Nwodim,” “Hollywood Handbook,” “StraightioLab” and more. All BMP podcasts are executive produced by Will Ferrell and iHeartMedia and are distributed by iHeartPodcasts. See the full catalog here.",
