hen you’re not wearing it.\nDisney Store Hulk and Spider-Man Minico Figures from Iron Studios\nSpider-Man and the Hulk are teaming up — or at least facing off — in this collectible MiniCo figure set from Iron Studios. The set includes both characters in detailed, stylized poses inspired by Spider-Man: Brand New Day.\nDisney Store Thor Stormbreaker Axe with Light and Sound Effects\nYou may not be worthy of Mjolnir, but you can still get your hands on Thor’s other iconic weapon with this Stormbreaker replica. The Marvel Vault collectible features light and sound effects that bring the MCU-inspired axe to life.\nOf course, there’s plenty more to come. Avengers: Doomsday isn’t scheduled to hit theaters until Dec. 18, 2026, leaving Marvel several more months to reveal new footage, characters, merchandise, and potentially a few surprises we don’t see coming. Until then, the latest collectibles are one way to keep the countdown going. See the most recent D23 Avengers: Doomsday trailer below.",
