        "title": "Dressed for power: Giorgia Meloni and the language of fashion",
        "link": "https://www.dw.com/en/dressed-for-power-giorgia-meloni-and-the-language-of-fashion/a-78413559?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss",
        "source": "Deutsche Welle",
