        "title": "The Ozempic Era Has Its Own Netflix Dating Show, and It’s Called ‘Weight to Date’",
        "link": "https://thoughtcatalog.com/xstockton/2026/08/the-ozempic-era-has-its-own-netflix-dating-show-and-its-called-weight-to-date/",
