        "title": "In China, ‘Hacks’ Is Called ‘the Diva and the Strawberry,’ and Fans Built a Whole Sims World Where the Characters Live Together in a Treehouse",
        "link": "https://thoughtcatalog.com/nadia-santiago/2026/08/in-china-hacks-is-called-the-diva-and-the-strawberry-and-fans-built-a-whole-sims-world-where-the-characters-live-together-in-a-treehouse/",
