        "link": "https://www.rockpapershotgun.com/mortal-shell-2-review-a-monumental-heavy-metal-sequel-with-the-spirit-of-a-90s-pc-game",
        "source": "Rock Paper Shotgun Latest Articles Feed",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
