        "title": "Battlefield 6's Top Gun collaboration is more involved than I expected, and it convinced me that Carrier Strike should be a permanent mode",
        "link": "https://www.eurogamer.net/battlefield-6-top-gun-carrier-strike-wake-island",
        "source": "Eurogamer.net Latest Articles Feed",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469602+00:00",
