        "title": "Shuhei Yoshida told Expedition 33 studio to avoid terms like 'turn-based RPG' because it may cause people to \"overlook\" the game",
        "link": "https://www.eurogamer.net/expedition-33-shuehi-yoshida-warning-turn-based-rpg",
