        "title": "It turns out touching grass is the answer: Gaming is great when you leave the house",
        "link": "https://www.eurogamer.net/touching-grass-gaming-going-outside-optimism-week",
        "source": "Eurogamer.net Latest Articles Feed",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469576+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.484529+00:00",
