        "image": "https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/a-plague-tale-resonance-sophia.jpg?width=1200&height=630&fit=crop&enable=upscale&auto=webp",
        "full_content": "Here's your next batch of Xbox and PC Game Pass games for August\nRats!\nThe next batch of Xbox and PC Game Pass games has been announced, detailing what's arriving in the latter part of August.\nThe undoubted focal point is the day-one addition of Asobo's new Plague Tale game, Resonance: A Plague Tale, which spins a prequel tale - across dual timelines - on the island of Crete.\nI've played Resonance: A Plague Tale and was enthusiastic about it. The series has ditched stealth gameplay and gone all-in on combat to great effect. Combine handsome set-pieces, tricky puzzles and incredible ruins, and you've got an appealing Tomb Raider and Uncharted-like adventure.\nAnother day-one Game Pass release to potentially get excited about is Blood Dungeon, the new game from Nidhogg creator Messhof. Nidhogg was a low-fi swashbuckling duel game that was a riot in a local co-op party setting. It sounds like Blood Dungeon is a Metroidvania kind of idea.\nIt's also worth noting that the Remastered edition of The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt leaves Game Pass at the end of the month, so if you've never taken the plunge, you've still got time - and a good reason with a new expansion on the way.\nAvailable on Game Pass now\n- Egging On (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, Handheld, and PC) – August 18, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\nComing to Game Pass soon\n- Vapor World: Over the Mind (Game Preview) (Cloud, Console, and PC) – August 19, Game Pass Ultimate, PC Game Pass\n- BlazBlue Entropy Effect X (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, and PC) – August 19, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\n- Relooted (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, and PC) – August 19, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\n- Starsand Island (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, and PC) – August 20, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\n- Aerial_Knight's DropShot (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, Handheld, and PC) – August 25, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\n- Blood Dungeon (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, and PC) – August 25, Game Pass Ultimate, PC Game Pass\n- Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy (Cloud, Xbox Series X/S, Handheld, and PC) – August 27, Game Pass Ultimate, PC Game Pass\n- Young Suns (Cloud, Console, and PC) – August 31, new on Game Pass Premium, already on Game Pass Ultimate and PC Game Pass\n- Shelldiver (Cloud, Console, and PC) – September 1, Game Pass Ultimate, Game Pass Premium, PC Game Pass\nLeaving Game Pass August 31\n- Another Crab's Treasure (Cloud, Console, and PC)\n- I Am Your Beast (Cloud, Console, and PC)\n- Neon Abyss (Cloud, Console, and PC)\n- One Lonely Outpost (Cloud, Console, and PC)\n- The Witcher 3: The Wild Hunt - Remastered Edition (Cloud and Console)\n- (Leaving 6th September) NBA 2K26 (Cloud, Console, and PC)\nGames with a \"handheld\" designation are optimised for handheld play.\nMac, PC, PS4, PlayStation Vita\nSee 2 more\nMac, Nintendo Switch, PC, PS4, Xbox One\nResonance: A Plague Tale Legacy\nPC, PS5, Xbox Series X/S",
