        "title": "Cinemark Joins AMC Theatres and Regal in Supporting Paramount-Warner Bros. Discovery Merger",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/film/news/cinemark-paramount-warner-bros-merger-amc-theatres-regal-1236836310/",
