        "title": "How the ‘Hacks’ Production Team Created a ’70s Sitcom Set and Overcame Las Vegas-Sized Challenges",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/artisans/awards/hacks-70s-sitcom-set-las-vegas-blackout-1236837382/",
        "source": "Variety",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469522+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.484449+00:00",
