        "title": "Motion Picture Academy Names Sean Baker and Samantha Quan as Chairs of Marquee Theater Committee",
        "link": "https://variety.com/2026/film/news/sean-baker-samantha-quan-ampas-theater-committee-1236837591/",
        "source": "Variety",
