        "title": "‘Nashville’ Alum Charles Esten Notes “Strange Coincidence” of Being in Greenville, South Carolina Days Before Hayden Panettiere’s Death",
        "link": "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/general-news/hayden-panettiere-death-charles-esten-nashville-coincidence-1236676365/",
        "source": "The Hollywood Reporter",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
