        "full_content": "If you purchase an independently reviewed product or service through a link on our website, The Hollywood Reporter may receive an affiliate commission.\nRosie O’Donnell is getting some serious praise for her weeklong talk show return. On Monday, Aug. 17, she kicked off her four-night stint guest hosting Jimmy Kimmel Live!, in what Kimmel called a “special treat” for Trump. New O’Donnell-hosted episodes will air every night through Thursday, Aug. 20 on ABC, which can also be livestreamed online via DirecTV (with a five-day free trial), Fubo (with a five-day free trial), Sling (in select markets) and Hulu + Live TV.\nFor those not yet subscribed, either DirecTV’s free trial or Fubo’s free trial will cover O’Donnell’s full week of hosting at no cost. Alternatively, new episodes will drop on a one-day delay on Hulu/Disney+, however the service does not offer a free trial.\nAt a Glance: How to Watch Rosie O’Donnell Host Jimmy Kimmel Live!\n- When: Monday, Aug. 17-Thursday, Aug. 20, 11:35 p.m. PT/ET\n- TV channel: ABC\n- Stream online: DirecTV, Fubo, Sling, Hulu + Live TV; next day on Hulu/Disney+ (also included in DirecTV Signature packages’ five-day free trial)\nWhen and Where to Watch Jimmy Kimmel Live! With Rosie O’Donnell: Air Dates, Time\nRosie O’Donnell’s four-show guest hosting run began on Monday, Aug. 17 and wraps up Thursday, Aug. 20. New episodes air at 11:35 p.m. PT/ET on ABC.\nWhere to Stream Jimmy Kimmel Live! With Rosie O’Donnell Online\nSince episodes air on ABC, they’ll also be available to watch live on any live TV streaming service that carries said network, namely DirecTV (with a five-day free trial), Fubo (with a five-day free trial), Sling (in select markets) and Hulu + Live TV.\nThe day after airing on cable, new episodes will drop on Hulu/Disney+, and while the streamer doesn’t offer a free trial directly, fans can get free access through any of DirecTV’s Signature packages, which include the Hulu and Disney bundle and offer a five-day free trial.",
