        "title": "‘Ragtime’ Sets Lincoln Center Record In Its Final Week; ‘Paranormal Activity’ Sells Out First Four Previews – Broadway Box Office Report",
        "link": "https://deadline.com/2026/08/broadway-box-office-ragtime-paranormal-activity-1237044419/",
