        "title": "Operation Blue Skies: Reducing aviation climate impact with AI",
        "link": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-research/blue-skies/",
        "source": "News from Google",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469127+00:00",
