        "title": "Ask a Scientist: How can researchers use AI to predict a flood?",
        "link": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/research/flood-prediction-ai/",
        "source": "News from Google",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469124+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.484109+00:00",
