        "title": "$1 million hacker challenge for Vercel Sandbox",
        "link": "https://vercel.com/blog/one-million-dollar-hacker-challenge-for-vercel-sandbox",
        "source": "Vercel News",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.469011+00:00",
