        "title": "What is Aggregate Performance Reporting Format (APRF)?",
        "link": "https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/insights/aggregate-performance-reporting-feedback",
        "source": "Twilio Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.468995+00:00",
