        "title": "Faster Dynamically Quantized Inference with XNNPack",
        "link": "https://blog.tensorflow.org/2024/04/faster-dynamically-quantized-inference-with-xnnpack.html",
        "source": "The TensorFlow Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
