        "title": "crates.io: development update",
        "link": "https://blog.rust-lang.org/2026/07/13/crates-io-development-update/",
        "source": "Rust Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.468276+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.483332+00:00",
