        "image": "https://wpblogassets.paytm.com/paytmblog/uploads/2026/08/scan-n-pay-2.png",
        "full_content": "Ever been ready to make a payment, but first had to unlock your phone, find the Paytm app and open it before you could scan the QR code?\nThose few seconds may not seem like much, but when you are standing at a busy café counter, paying for a quick lunch or splitting a bill with friends, every extra step can feel unnecessary.\nThat is where the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget comes in.\nWith the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget on your mobile home screen, you can get quick access to Scan & Pay in just one tap. No need to open the Paytm app first. Simply tap the widget, scan the QR code and complete your Paytm UPI payments.\nMake Paytm UPI Payments Faster\nMobile payments are already a part of everyday life. From your morning coffee to dinner plans with friends, there are plenty of moments when you just want to scan, pay and move on.\nThe Paytm Scan & Pay Widget helps make that process quicker by putting access to Scan & Pay right on your mobile home screen.\nInstead of opening the Paytm app and navigating to the payment option, you can simply tap the widget and get started. It is especially useful when you are in a hurry.\nYou’re standing in a queue, there’s a long line behind you, and suddenly you feel the pressure to pay ASAP. No time to search for the app or go through extra steps.\nWith the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget, you can quickly access Scan & Pay and make your payment in a few simple steps.\nHow the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget Works\nSetting up the widget is simple. You can add the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget to your mobile home screen for quick access whenever you need to make a payment.\nOnce it is there, you do not need to open the Paytm app every time you want to pay. Just tap the widget, scan the QR code and complete your Paytm UPI payment securely using your PIN, wherever required.\nIt is a small change, but one that can make your everyday mobile payments feel a little more convenient.\nLess Searching, More Paying\nYour phone’s home screen is where you access the things you use most. So if Scan & Pay is something you use regularly, having quick access to it can save you those extra taps.\nThe Paytm Scan & Pay Widget is designed to make the payment journey more direct. No searching for the app. No unnecessary steps before you can scan and pay.\nJust one tap to get started. Whether you are paying for your usual coffee, picking up a quick snack or handling the bill during a weekend plan, the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget helps you get to your Paytm UPI payments faster.\nBecause sometimes, the best shortcut is the one already waiting on your home screen. Add the Paytm Scan & Pay Widget and keep Paytm UPI payments just one tap away. ⚡",
