        "title": "Anatomy of a Frontier Lab Agent Intrusion: A Technical Timeline of the July 2026 Incident",
        "link": "https://huggingface.co/blog/agent-intrusion-technical-timeline",
        "source": "Hugging Face - Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
