        "content": "The Go Blog\nResults from the 2025 Go Developer Survey\nHello! In this article we’ll discuss the results of the 2025 Go Developer Survey, conducted during September 2025.\nThank you to the 5,379 Go developers who responded to our survey invitation this year. Your feedback helps both the Go team at Google and the wider Go community understand the current state of the Go ecosystem and prioritize projec...",
