        "title": "Unveiling good and bad behaviors on the Agentic Internet",
        "link": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/good-and-bad-agentic-behaviors/",
        "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.467098+00:00",
