        "full_content": "Transform your product operating model for the AI era\nFrom customer signals to portfolio bets, see the truth in real time. Capture work, expose drift and risk, and tie progress to revenue and outcomes.\nTrusted by\nBuild better products, ship faster\nDisconnected data and inconsistent execution lead to missed targets. Use AI-powered workflows to end the guesswork and guide everything from product discovery to launch.\nWork smarter with AI\nGet complete, real-time visibility\nAdapt to your workflow\nOne flexible system of work for strategy, delivery, and iteration\nUnify customer signals, product planning, and execution in one AI workspace. Context flows automatically, data-driven decisions speed up, and value compounds every quarter.\nAlign features to real customer needs\nManage customer feedback\nConnect all your channels in one place, and automatically identify high value opportunities.\nExtract insights automatically\nUse AI to pull key themes from feature requests, Gong calls,customer surveys, and prototype reviews, then auto-add to backlog.\nClose the loop\nCreate release notes with AI to notify users when you address feedback and release new product features.\nDrive product decisions\nAlign your product vision to company strategy\nCreate strategies and roadmaps based on your company prioritization frameworks, user feedback, and product analytics.\nOptimize team resources\nPlan for high-impact initiatives and balance capacity across product teams with AI resourcing recommendations.\nDeliver executive visibility\nTrack progress against key metrics with executive dashboards, Kanban boards, and Gantt charts– with real-time visualization.\nMaximize every sprint\nManage dependencies\nMonitor cross-functional capacity across programs.\nKeep software development in sync\nAlign planning and engineering capacity by integrating with SaaS tools like Atlassian Jira and Azure DevOps.\nDetect strategic drift\nUse AI-driven roadmapping tools to spot