        "title": "AI can demystify supply chain regulations for global businesses — if geopolitics don't get in the way",
        "link": "https://www.businessinsider.com/us-china-trade-altana-supply-chain-software-2026-8",
        "source": "All Content from Business Insider",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.466409+00:00",
