        "title": "OpenAI data center deal with Nvidia comes in $145 billion lower than reported—signaling concerns of artificial demand for chips",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/openai-data-center-deal-with-nvidia-comes-in-145-billion-lower-than-reportedsignaling-concerns-of-artificial-demand-for-chips/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.466330+00:00",
