        "title": "Married 69 years, this philanthropic couple died 8 days apart—after giving away more than $20 million from a hotel-and-property fortune",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/philanthropic-couple-roy-nola-thompson-20-million-sunshine-coast-queensland/",
