        "title": "The Iran war may kill the ‘freedom of seas’ worldwide and everyone would pay the price",
        "link": "https://fortune.com/2026/08/18/global-freedom-seas-dying-strait-hormuz-everyone-everywhere-pay-tolls/",
        "source": "Fortune | FORTUNE",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.466005+00:00",
