        "title": "Quote of the Day by Nobel laureate Rabindranath Tagore: 'Don't limit a child to your own learning…'",
        "link": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/quote-of-the-day-by-nobel-laureate-rabindranath-tagore-dont-limit-a-child-to-your-own-learning-11787069716455.html",
        "source": "mint - news",
<<<<<<< Updated upstream
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T19:44:08.465572+00:00",
=======
        "timestamp": "2026-08-18T20:19:42.480283+00:00",
